{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And Elohim called the dry land Earth.</b> He called the part by the name of the whole, for indeed this part was the principal element intended among them all, as it says (Isaiah 45:18): לָשֶׁבֶת יְצָרָהּ — \"He formed it to be inhabited.\"" "<b>And Elohim saw that it was good.</b> He was pleased with it for the sake of the end, which is the intended good."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:41.785678802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}